1
00:00:05,831 --> 00:00:08,331
(Leonard:)Hey, Penny and I are gonna go
shop for a dining room table.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,670
(Leonard:)You want to come with us?

3
00:00:09,835 --> 00:00:13,615
I'd love to, but, I'm too busy

4
00:00:13,772 --> 00:00:16,942
(Sheldon:)falling back in love
with Windows 98.

5
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,890
(Leonard:)Seriously? You haven't used
this desk in years.

6
00:00:21,046 --> 00:00:23,046
(Leonard:)The second I want to get rid of it,
you're up here working?

7
00:00:23,215 --> 00:00:24,625
(Sheldon:)I can't talk right now.

8
00:00:24,783 --> 00:00:27,233
(Sheldon:)I have several thousand updates
to install.

9
00:00:28,286 --> 00:00:29,956
(Leonard:)Are you really
gonna sit here all day?

10
00:00:30,122 --> 00:00:32,502
(Sheldon:)Think of me as Arthur Dent in

11
00:00:32,658 --> 00:00:34,698
(Sheldon:)Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy,

12
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:37,740
(Sheldon:)lying in front of the bulldozers
to protect his home.

13
00:00:37,896 --> 00:00:41,176
(Leonard:)If you'll recall, the Vogon fleet
blew up the Earth anyway.

14
00:00:41,299 --> 00:00:43,969
It's a made-up story. I don't even
know why you're talking about it.

15
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:48,003
(Leonard:)I'm putting all this stuff
in storage. We don't need any of it.

16
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,850
(Sheldon:)How can you say that?

17
00:00:49,908 --> 00:00:53,358
(Sheldon:)You show me one thing
in here we can live without.

18
00:00:53,412 --> 00:00:54,912
(Leonard:)Hang on.

19
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:01,020
(Leonard:)Check your in-box.

